OL,4,AGrampian statement
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney faces questions from
OL,7,Fbackbench MSPs for about half an hour
OL,9,FAfter FMQs more details will be
OL,10,Fannounced about an independent review
OL,11,Fof how NHS Grampian has handled certain
OL,12,Fsurgeries, including liver and pancreas
OL,13,Foperations
OL,15,FAt the weekend, the Scottish government
OL,16,Fordered the review in light of a
OL,17,Fwhistleblower leaking a document
OL,18,Fshowing there were 19 avoidable deaths
